SUMMARY:Cape May Ferry/Zoo Weekend RSVP Required RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Welcome to the Rehoboth
 / Cape May Weekend bicycle rides.**\n**-as of today there will be 28 of us
 .**\n**-the weather will be perfect all weekend with highs 65-70 degrees.*
 *\n\n**-our first ride on Friday. ..leaving the parking lot of the hotel a
 t 3pm to ride south along the Coastal Highway to the Indian River Outlet B
 ridge and back. Just past our motel\, on the same side\, we will ride to t
 he Bushel Sports Bar and Grill for dinner together. Those arriving later m
 ay wish to meet us there. For this ride and Saturday’s ride please have 
 lights on your bicycle because we will be getting back after dark.**\n**-S
 aturday morning we will be on our bicycles at 7:15 am to ride to the Cape 
 May Ferry to sign in at 8am. In addition to the ticket you bought for the 
 ferry\, you will need to show a government photo ID. When we return to Lew
 es on the ferry\, riding back\, ½ mile from the hotel\, we will stop at C
 rooked Hammock Brewery for dinner together.**\n**-On Sunday morning check 
 out of the hotel and be on your bike ready to ride at 9am. We will ride th
 e four trails ride. …back to the hotel by noon to leave for home.**\n\n*
 *-You must wear a helmet**\n**-These are casual rides. You are asked to st
 ay with the group**\n**-Please have a tube for your tires\, so someone can
  fix your flat**\n**-Please call me or text me with additional questions**
 \n**Richard Conner 717-572-8480**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154872
 25/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260630T174329Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260630T174329Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
