SUMMARY:Intermediate Ride (C) - LV Ephrata Dutch Long (39h)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, an
 d Ride Together**\n\n**Ride leader: Aaron Siebert**\n**Ride sweep: TBD**\n
 \n**Anticipated Average Pace: (14-16 mph)**\n\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/rou
 tes/18351680\n\n**This is an Intermediate C Class ride. The ride leader wi
 ll ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ri
 de with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her b
 est to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and/or splittin
 g into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.**\n\n**Please do not
  join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If you exce
 ed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join
  a faster group. If maintaining a 14-16 mph average is beyond your current
  ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.**\n\n**Helme
 ts are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (s
 pare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).**\n\n**To eliminate passing 
 around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup 
 RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club
  member. Join here** [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/con
 tent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\n**Your RSVP is your agreement to a
 bide by the club's Code of Conduct:** [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancas
 terbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n
 \n**Guidance if an incident occurs:** [Incident Actions](https://lancaster
 bikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3171629
