SUMMARY:Fun Ride:  Pretzels\, Pastries & more   22F  -- RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRIDE LEADER: Christina Du
 bin RIDE\nSWEEP: Andrea Frank\n\nLink to route:\n[Pretzels\, Pastries & mo
 re](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/52550058?via=cn7y6rxYB33dklAaLab1SA) Fo
 llow the leader!\n\nFUN Rides: Distance less than 25 miles\, ride leader a
 verage pace about 11 mph or less\, group will wait for all cyclists. Frequ
 ent rest stops. Good pace for beginners and families. Try a Fun Ride if yo
 u're not sure of your ability.\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also plan
  to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire leve
 rs\, pump/CO2 inflator). Being a Meetup Member does not mean you are a clu
 b member. Use this link to join the club. Your RSVP is your agreement to a
 bide by the club's Code of Conduct and Rules of the Road
